                                        Tidak ada biaya beban toko selama shift ini. Klik "+ Tambah Beban Toko" jika ada pengeluaran kasir.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex justify-between pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
                                    <span>Subtotal Biaya Beban Toko:</span>
                                    <span id="closing-sub-expense" class="font-bold text-rose-700 font-mono">Rp 0</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Pane 2: Kasbon Karyawan -->
                            <div id="disb-pane-loan" class="disb-tab-pane space-y-2.5 hidden">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Kasbon Karyawan (Pinjaman Tunai dari Laci Kasir)</span>
                                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block sm:inline sm:ml-1">• Terhubung ke Pencatatan Gaji / Potongan Kasbon</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="addShiftLoanRow()" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 border border-amber-200 text-amber-800 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-black transition-colors flex items-center space-x-1">
                                        <span>+</span><span>Tambah Kasbon</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="closing-loans-list" class="space-y-2 max-h-48 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                                    <div class="empty-loan-note text-center py-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400 italic bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-200">
                                        Tidak ada kasbon karyawan selama shift ini. Klik "+ Tambah Kasbon" jika ada pencairan kasbon kasir.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex justify-between pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
                                    <span>Subtotal Kasbon Karyawan:</span>
                                    <span id="closing-sub-loan" class="font-bold text-amber-800 font-mono">Rp 0</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Pane 3: Uang Makan Karyawan -->
                            <div id="disb-pane-meal" class="disb-tab-pane space-y-2.5 hidden">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Uang Makan Karyawan Shift</span>
                                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block sm:inline sm:ml-1">• Terhubung ke Pencatatan Gaji & Beban Operasional</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="addShiftMealRow()" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-black transition-colors flex items-center space-x-1">
                                        <span>+</span><span>Tambah Uang Makan</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="closing-meals-list" class="space-y-2 max-h-48 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                                    <div class="empty-meal-note text-center py-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400 italic bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-200">
                                        Tidak ada uang makan yang dicairkan. Klik "+ Tambah Uang Makan" jika kasir memberikan uang makan tunai.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex justify-between pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
                                    <span>Subtotal Uang Makan Karyawan:</span>
                                    <span id="closing-sub-meal" class="font-bold text-emerald-800 font-mono">Rp 0</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Input Uang Fisik Aktual di Laci Kasir -->
                        <div class="space-y-1.5 pt-1">
                            <label class="block text-xs font-black text-slate-800">Total Uang Fisik Aktual di Laci Kasir (Kertas + Koin):</label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">Rp</span>
                                <input type="number" id="shift-input-actual-cash" oninput="calculateClosingCashDifference(window.closingShiftState ? window.closingShiftState.expectedCash : ${expectedCash})" placeholder="Hitung dan input seluruh uang fisik..." class="w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-2 bg-white border-2 border-rose-300 rounded-xl font-black text-rose-950 text-sm sm:text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500 shadow-inner">
                            </div>
                            <div id="closing-cash-status-box" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span>💡</span><span>Masukkan total uang fisik di laci kasir untuk menghitung selisih kas secara otomatis.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2. Laporan Stok Fisik Akhir Malam (Closing Stock) -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                            <div>
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                    <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider">Laporan Stok Fisik Akhir Malam (Closing Stock)</span>
                                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-black bg-slate-200 text-slate-800">Serah Terima</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="block text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Sisa stok fisik di toko malam ini yang akan diserahterimakan ke shift pagi berikutnya.</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500">Hitung Fisik Sisa</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Header Kolom Komparasi -->
                        <div class="hidden sm:grid sm:grid-cols-12 gap-3 px-3 text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">
                            <div class="sm:col-span-5">Produk / Bahan Baku</div>
                            <div class="sm:col-span-3 text-center">Stok Awal Pagi</div>
                            <div class="sm:col-span-4 text-center">Input Sisa Fisik Malam Ini</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Baris Item Komparasi -->
                        <div class="space-y-2.5">
                            ${closingItemsRows}
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-[11px] text-amber-900 flex items-start space-x-2">
                            <span class="text-base leading-none">🌙</span>
                            <span class="leading-relaxed">
                                <b>Penting untuk Shift Terakhir:</b> Laporan sisa stok fisik malam yang Anda simpan di sini akan <b>otomatis terkunci</b> dan menjadi <b>STOK MALAM</b> bagi kasir shift pagi esok hari.
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2.3 Pencatatan Meteran Air Mesin Isi Ulang (Display Counter) -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-cyan-50/40 to-white p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-sky-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3.5">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-sky-100 pb-2 flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span class="text-base">💧</span>
                                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-sky-950 uppercase tracking-wider">Meteran Air Mesin Isi Ulang (Display Counter)</span>
                                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black bg-sky-100 text-sky-800">Closing Harian</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-sky-700 bg-white/90 border border-sky-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-lg font-mono font-bold">
                                Rumus: (Hari Ini - Kemarin) / 782
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                            Karyawan shift terakhir mencatat angka counter terakhir yang tertera pada display meteran mesin isi ulang untuk menghitung estimasi pengeluaran galon.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Baris Input Counter: Kemarin vs Hari Ini vs Hasil Galon -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-end">
                            <!-- Meteran Kemarin (Awal) -->
                            <div class="sm:col-span-4 space-y-1">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <label class="text-[11px] font-black text-slate-700 uppercase">Meter Kemarin (Awal):</label>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="unlockYesterdayMeter()" id="btn-unlock-yesterday" class="text-[10px] font-bold text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-800 underline">Ubah</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="relative">
                                    <input type="number" step="any" id="closing-meter-yesterday" value="${meterYesterday}" readonly class="w-full py-2.5 px-3 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 transition-all">
                                </div>
                                <span class="block text-[9px] text-slate-400 italic">${meterYesterdayDate ? 'Terakhir dicatat: ' + escapeHtml(meterYesterdayDate) : 'Belum ada catatan sebelumnya'}</span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Meteran Hari Ini (Display Akhir) -->
                            <div class="sm:col-span-4 space-y-1">
                                <label class="text-[11px] font-black text-sky-950 uppercase flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span>Meter Hari Ini (Display):</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-rose-500 font-bold">*Wajib shift akhir</span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="relative">
                                    <input type="number" step="any" id="closing-meter-today" oninput="calculateWaterMeterOutput()" placeholder="Catat angka counter..." class="w-full py-2.5 px-3 bg-white border-2 border-sky-400 rounded-xl font-mono font-black text-sky-950 text-sm sm:text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 shadow-inner">
                                </div>
                                <span class="block text-[9px] text-slate-400">Angka meteran saat penutupan shift</span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hasil Pengeluaran Air (Galon) -->
                            <div class="sm:col-span-4 bg-sky-600 text-white p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-sm text-center flex flex-col justify-center">
                                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-sky-100 block">Pengeluaran Air (Galon)</span>
                                <span id="closing-meter-dispensed-preview" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black font-mono tracking-tight block mt-0.5">0.00 Galon</span>
                                <span id="closing-meter-diff-pulsa" class="text-[9px] text-sky-200 block font-mono mt-0.5">Selisih: 0 pulsa</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Accordion Toggle Adjustment / Koreksi Meteran -->
                        <div class="pt-1">
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleWaterMeterAdjustmentForm()" class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-900 flex items-center space-x-1.5 transition-colors">
                                <span id="closing-meter-adj-icon">➕</span>
                                <span id="closing-meter-adj-toggle-text">Tambah Koreksi / Adjustment Nilai Meteran (Opsional)</span>
                            </button>

                            <!-- Form Adjustment Collapsible -->
                            <div id="closing-meter-adj-container" class="hidden mt-2.5 p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-sky-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-2.5">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-1.5">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase">Form Adjustment / Koreksi Pengeluaran Air</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Gunakan jika ada kalibrasi sensor, bilas pipa, atau error</span>
                                </div>

                                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-xs">
                                    <div>
                                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">Jenis Koreksi:</label>
                                        <select id="closing-meter-adj-type" onchange="calculateWaterMeterOutput()" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800">
                                            <option value="PULSE">Pulsa Meteran (/ 782)</option>
                                            <option value="GALON">Galon Langsung (+/-)</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">Nilai Koreksi (+ / -):</label>
                                        <input type="number" step="any" id="closing-meter-adj-val" oninput="calculateWaterMeterOutput()" value="0" placeholder="0" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-800">
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        <label class="block font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">Alasan Penyesuaian:</label>
                                        <input type="text" id="closing-meter-adj-reason" placeholder="Contoh: Kuras pipa filter 5 galon" class="w-full p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-slate-800">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 bg-sky-50/50 p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span>Total Output Setelah Koreksi:</span>
                                    <span id="closing-meter-final-adjusted-galon" class="font-mono font-black text-sky-900">0.00 Galon</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2.5 Opsi Penutupan Toko Harian (Final Shift) -->
                    <div class="bg-indigo-50/70 p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                        <div class="flex items-start sm:items-center space-x-2.5">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="check-is-final-shift" ${isFinalCandidate ? 'checked' : ''} class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 sm:mt-0 text-indigo-600 rounded focus:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer">
                            <div>
                                <label for="check-is-final-shift" class="text-xs font-black text-indigo-950 block cursor-pointer">Tutup Toko Hari Ini (Closing Akhir / Selesai Operasional Malam 🌙)</label>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-indigo-700 block leading-tight">Centang jika ini adalah penutupan shift terakhir hari ini. Sisa stok fisik akan terkunci permanen sebagai Stok Akhir Malam Toko.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xl shrink-0">🏪</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3. Catatan Shift / Serah Terima (Opsional) -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Catatan Serah Terima / Operasional Shift (Opsional):</label>
                        <textarea id="shift-input-notes" rows="2" placeholder="Tuliskan catatan kejadian penting, kendala kasir, atau pesan untuk shift berikutnya..." class="w-full p-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs text-slate-800 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400"></textarea>
                    </div>
                `;
                } catch (err) {
                    console.error("Gagal render closing shift modal:", err);
                    body.innerHTML = `
                        <div class="p-6 text-center text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 space-y-3">
                            <span class="text-2xl">⚠️</span>
                            <div class="text-xs font-bold">Gagal memuat data Closing Shift: ${escapeHtml(err.message || 'Terjadi kesalahan sistem')}</div>
                            <button onclick="openShiftModal()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold hover:bg-rose-700">Coba Lagi</button>
                        </div>
                    `;
                }
            } else {
                // ==========================================
                // OPENING SHIFT (BUKA PENJUALAN / SHIFT PAGI / SHIFT SIANG)
                // ==========================================
                body.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center py-12 text-slate-400">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 border-3 border-emerald-600 border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin mr-3"></div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Memuat data serah terima shift & stok produk...</span>
                    </div>
                `;

                document.getElementById('shift-modal').classList.remove('hidden');

                try {
                    const res = await fetch(`api.php?action=get_opening_shift_data&branch_id=${branchId}`);
                    const data = await res.json();

                    if (data.has_active_open_shift && data.active_open_shift) {
                        state.activeShift = data.active_open_shift;
                        renderShiftBanner();
                        return openShiftModal();
                    }

                    const nextNum = data.next_shift_number || 1;
                    const nextName = data.next_shift_name || (nextNum === 1 ? 'Shift 1 (Pagi)' : 'Shift 2 (Siang/Malam)');
                    const refTitle = data.shift_reference_title || 'STOK ACUAN MALAM (Terkunci 🔒)';
                    const isContinuation = data.is_continuation || false;
                    const prevInfo = data.previous_shift_info;

                    title.innerHTML = `
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 flex-wrap">
                            <span>Opening Kasir: ${escapeHtml(nextName)}</span>
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black ${nextNum === 1 ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'} uppercase tracking-wider">
                                ${nextNum === 1 ? 'Shift 1: Pagi / Awal 🌅' : 'Shift ' + nextNum + ': Siang / Malam (Serah Terima) 🌤️'}
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    `;
                    desc.innerText = `Cabang: ${state.currentBranch?.name || 'Cabang'} • Kasir: ${state.currentUser?.name || 'Kasir'}`;
                    btn.innerText = `BUKA ${nextName.toUpperCase()}`;
                    btn.className = 'py-3.5 px-5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-200 transition-all uppercase tracking-wider';
                    btn.setAttribute('data-next-shift-number', nextNum);
                    btn.setAttribute('data-next-shift-name', nextName);

                    const initCash = data.default_modal || 300000;
                    const items = data.items || [];

                    let handoverBannerHtml = '';
                    if (isContinuation && prevInfo) {
                        handoverBannerHtml = `
                            <div class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2.5 text-xs text-amber-950">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                                    <span class="text-xl shrink-0">🤝</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="font-black text-amber-900">Serah Terima dari ${escapeHtml(prevInfo.cashier_name || 'Kasir')} (${escapeHtml(prevInfo.shift_name || 'Shift ' + (nextNum - 1))})</div>
                                        <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-800/90 mt-0.5">Shift sebelumnya telah ditutup pada <b>${prevInfo.end_time || '-'}</b>. Sisa fisik otomatis diselaraskan.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-200/80 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-black text-amber-900 uppercase">Stok Terhubung ✅</span>
                            </div>
                        `;
                    }

                    let openingInputsHtml = '';
                    let nightInputsHtml = '';

                    if (items.length > 0) {
                        // Kolom Kiri: PENAMBAHAN STOK PAGI (+) (Kasir Pertama Hari Ini)
                        // Rumus: Stok Awal = Input Tambahan + Stok Malam
                        openingInputsHtml = items.map(item => {
                            let legacyId = '';
                            if (item.sku === 'RAW-089') legacyId = 'id="opening-raw-mineral"';
                            else if (item.sku === 'RAW-020') legacyId = 'id="opening-raw-ro"';
                            else if (item.sku === 'RAW-00092') legacyId = 'id="opening-raw-plastik"';

                            const itemName = escapeHtml(item.name || item.sku);
                            const itemUnit = escapeHtml(item.unit || 'pcs');

                            return `
                                <div class="bg-white/95 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-2xs flex flex-col space-y-2">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                                                <span class="text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase leading-snug break-words">${itemName}</span>
                                                <span class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded font-bold">${itemUnit}</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <span class="block text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">${item.sku} • Stok Malam: <b class="text-slate-700">${item.night_stock}</b> ${itemUnit}</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 shrink-0">
                                            <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600">+</span>
                                            <input type="number" ${legacyId} data-product-id="${item.product_id}" data-sku="${item.sku}" data-product-name="${itemName}" data-unit="${itemUnit}" data-night-stock="${item.night_stock}" oninput="calculateOpeningShiftVariance()" value="0" min="0" placeholder="0" class="shift-added-item-input w-20 sm:w-24 text-center py-1.5 px-2 bg-emerald-50/50 border-2 border-emerald-300 rounded-xl font-black text-emerald-950 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 shadow-inner">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="item-calc-badge-${item.product_id}" class="text-[11px] pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-600 transition-all">
                                        <span>Stok Awal: <b class="font-mono text-slate-900 font-black">${item.night_stock}</b> ${itemUnit}</span>
                                        <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-600">✓ Stok Tetap</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            `;
                        }).join('');

                        // Kolom Kanan: STOK ACUAN MALAM (Terkunci 🔒 / Readonly)
                        nightInputsHtml = items.map(item => {
                            let legacyIdNight = '';
                            if (item.sku === 'RAW-089') legacyIdNight = 'id="closing-night-mineral"';
                            else if (item.sku === 'RAW-020') legacyIdNight = 'id="closing-night-ro"';
                            else if (item.sku === 'RAW-00092') legacyIdNight = 'id="closing-night-plastik"';

                            const itemName = escapeHtml(item.name || item.sku);
                            const itemUnit = escapeHtml(item.unit || 'pcs');

                            return `
                                <div class="bg-white/90 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col space-y-2">
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                                                <span class="text-xs font-black text-slate-700 uppercase leading-snug break-words">${itemName}</span>
                                                <span class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded font-bold">${itemUnit}</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <span class="block text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">${item.sku} • Sisa Closing Kemarin</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="w-20 sm:w-24 text-center py-1.5 px-2 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl font-black text-slate-700 text-sm shadow-inner relative">
                                            <input type="hidden" ${legacyIdNight} data-product-id="${item.product_id}" value="${item.night_stock}" class="shift-night-item-input">
                                            <span>${item.night_stock}</span>
                                            <span class="absolute right-1.5 top-2 text-[10px] text-slate-400">🔒</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-[11px] pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500">
                                        <span>Total Stok Awal:</span>
                                        <span id="item-night-total-${item.product_id}" class="font-mono font-black text-indigo-950">${item.night_stock} ${itemUnit}</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            `;
                        }).join('');
                    } else {
                        openingInputsHtml = `
                            <div class="p-4 text-center text-xs text-emerald-700 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100">
                                Tidak ada produk pelacakan stok yang terdaftar untuk opening shift.
                            </div>
                        `;
                        nightInputsHtml = `
